        "passage": "The FTC describes payment-app scams in which an impostor claims to be a bank or trusted person and instructs the recipient to move money to a new account. The guidance emphasizes independently verifying the request and recognizing that payment-app transfers can be difficult to reverse. It does not classify any individual payment as fraudulent.",
